	<h2>Card with Interactions</h2>
	<CodeExample>
		<article class='card blur-in-on-scroll'>
			<div class='card-container navigation-card'>
				<Image
					class='card-image'
					src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1773062189964-75a471b19934?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D'
					width={300}
					height={300}
					alt='A blue vinyl record player on a wooden side table'
				/>
				<div class='card-content'>
					<div class='stack gap-2xs'>
						<div class='cluster gap-2xs'>
							<span class='badge'>Default</span>
							<span class='badge accent'>Accent</span>
							<span class='badge info'>Info</span>
							<span class='badge success'>Success</span>
							<span class='badge warning'>Warning</span>
							<span class='badge danger'>Danger</span>
						</div>
						<h2><a href='#test' class='navigation-card-link'>Title</a></h2>
					</div>
					<p class='max-lines'>
						Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Obcaecati, debitis
						atque sapiente, dolor eaque maxime quisquam, ut qui animi quae itaque minus
						reprehenderit expedita. Ratione voluptatum aut exercitationem neque iusto.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class='card-interactions'>
				<button type='button'><ShoppingBasketIcon /> Add to basket</button>
			</div>
		</article>
	</CodeExample>

	<h2>Card with Date</h2>
	<CodeExample>
		<article class='card flip-in-on-scroll'>
			<div class='card-container'>
				<div class='card-date-span'>
					<CalendarIcon aria-hidden='true' />
					<span class='card-date-span-text'>
						<time datetime='2026-10-28'>28 okt</time>
						-
						<time datetime='2026-11-14'>14 nov</time>
					</span>
				</div>
				<div class='card-content'>
					<div class='stack gap-2xs'>
						<div class='cluster gap-2xs'>
							<span class='badge'>Default</span>
							<span class='badge accent'>Accent</span>
							<span class='badge info'>Info</span>
							<span class='badge success'>Success</span>
							<span class='badge warning'>Warning</span>
							<span class='badge danger'>Danger</span>
						</div>
						<h2>Title</h2>
					</div>
					<p class='max-lines'>
						Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Obcaecati, debitis
						atque sapiente, dolor eaque maxime quisquam, ut qui animi quae itaque minus
						reprehenderit expedita. Ratione voluptatum aut exercitationem neque iusto.
					</p>
					<a href='#test'>Lorem ipsum dolor sit</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</article>
	</CodeExample>

	<h2>Card without Image</h2>
